{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778531029217,"sessionID":"ses_1e74a4a85ffeMT9yLBjpWtHWAc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-ac9eefc5ea38ffd1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json"},"output":"<path>/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"related #2097\\n\\n**tendon cell**\\n\\n- reclassify to 'fibroblast' and 'part of' some 'tendon' \\n- adjust the textual def accordingly\\n\\n**otic fibrocyte**\\n- reclassify from fibrocyte to mesenchymal cell (PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/))\\n- add synonyms - cochlear fibrocyte (PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)) and spiral ligament fibrocyte (PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/)\\n\\n**In a seperate ticket - refine otic fibrobalst and subclasses**\\n1) Currently, otic fibroblast is linked to spiral ligmanet but it encompasses both spiral ligament and spiral limbus - This definition should be relabelled to Cochlear fibrocytes (more widely used) and treated as the general term \\n2) A spiral ligament fibrocyte term should be added and all Type I-V subclasses should be added under it \\n3) More info should be added to the textual defs of the subclasses (especially functions) \\n\\nUseful refs \\n\\n- PMID: 24727668\\n- PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)\\n- PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/) - newer paper\\n- PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/) - newer paper -specific to Spiral ligament fibrocytes\\n\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"remove tendon cell and otic fibrocyte from under fibrocyte\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3239\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"related #2097\\n\\n**tendon cell**\\n\\n- reclassify to 'fibroblast' and 'part of' some 'tendon' \\n- adjust the textual def accordingly\\n\\n**otic fibrocyte**\\n- reclassify from fibrocyte to mesenchymal cell (PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/))\\n- add synonyms - cochlear fibrocyte (PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)) and spiral ligament fibrocyte (PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/)\\n\\n**In a seperate ticket - refine otic fibrobalst and subclasses**\\n1) Currently, otic fibroblast is linked to spiral ligmanet but it encompasses both spiral ligament and spiral limbus - This definition should be relabelled to Cochlear fibrocytes (more widely used) and treated as the general term \\n2) A spiral ligament fibrocyte term should be added and all Type I-V subclasses should be added under it \\n3) More info should be added to the textual defs of the subclasses (especially functions) \\n\\nUseful refs \\n\\n- PMID: 24727668\\n- PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)\\n- PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/) - newer paper\\n- PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/) - newer paper -specific to Spiral ligament fibrocytes\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"remove tendon cell and otic fibrocyte from under fibrocyte\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3239\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778531029198,"end":1778531029216}},"id":"prt_e18b5c69d001Avaw5G3V3TujiO","sessionID":"ses_1e74a4a85ffeMT9yLBjpWtHWAc","messageID":"msg_e18b5b632001vdbHUwRTzXTkUS"}}
